---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Terms of Service',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 md:py-16 dark:text-slate-300">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tighter tracking-tighter mb-4 font-heading dark:text-gray-200">
      Terms of Service
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-muted mb-2">Anderson CFO LLC ("ACFO")</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-8">Effective Date: March 24, 2026</p>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using the website
        <a href="https://acfo.co" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 underline">https://acfo.co</a> or any
        services provided by Anderson CFO LLC ("ACFO," "we," "us," or "our"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of
        Service. If you do not agree, do not use our website or services.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Services</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        ACFO provides fractional CFO services, financial consulting, and data integration services to business clients.
        Our services include, but are not limited to:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
        <li>Financial reporting and analysis</li>
        <li>Data warehouse setup and management</li>
        <li>Integration of third-party platforms including Amazon Selling Partner data via the SP-API</li>
        <li>Business intelligence and analytics consulting</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Client Relationships</h2>
      <p>
        Our services are provided under separate engagement agreements with each client. These Terms of Service govern
        the use of our website and general interactions with ACFO. In the event of a conflict between these Terms and a
        specific client engagement agreement, the engagement agreement controls.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Use of Our Website</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        You agree to use our website only for lawful purposes and in accordance with these Terms. You agree not to:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
        <li>Use our website in any way that violates applicable laws or regulations</li>
        <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to any part of our website or systems</li>
        <li>Interfere with the proper functioning of our website</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        All content on our website, including text, graphics, logos, and software, is the property of Anderson CFO LLC
        or its licensors and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>
        Our services may involve integration with third-party platforms, including Amazon Selling Partner API, Fivetran,
        Google BigQuery, and others. Your use of these third-party services is subject to their respective terms and
        conditions. ACFO is not responsible for the availability, performance, or policies of third-party services.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Amazon Selling Partner API</h2>
      <p>
        When we access Amazon Selling Partner data on behalf of a client, we do so in compliance with Amazon's
        Acceptable Use Policy, Data Protection Policy, and the Solution Provider Agreement. Authorization to access a
        client's Amazon data is granted by the client and may be revoked at any time.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, ACFO shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special,
        consequential, or punitive damages arising out of or relating to your use of our website or services. Our total
        liability for any claim arising from these Terms shall not exceed the amount paid by you to ACFO in the twelve
        months preceding the claim.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        Our website and services are provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, either express
        or implied. We do not warrant that our website will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of harmful components.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Indemnification</h2>
      <p>
        You agree to indemnify and hold harmless ACFO and its officers, employees, and agents from any claims, damages,
        losses, or expenses arising out of your violation of these Terms or your use of our website.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Oregon, without regard to its conflict of laws principles.
        Any disputes arising under these Terms shall be resolved in the courts located in Multnomah County, Oregon.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these Terms from time to time. We will post the updated Terms on our website with a revised
        effective date. Your continued use of our website after any changes constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Anderson CFO LLC</p>
      <p>
        Email: <a href="mailto:harold@acfo.co" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 underline">harold@acfo.co</a>
      </p>
      <p>
        Website: <a href="https://acfo.co" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 underline">https://acfo.co</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
